{"id":"4e07e37041cb639b","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-los-theorem.md","title":"Los Theorem","display":"Los Theorem","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-los-theorem","aliases":["93-lem-los-theorem"],"display":"Los Theorem","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-first-order-ultraproduct]]","[[93-df-first-order-satisfaction]]","[[93-df-set-ultrafilter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-los-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-los-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Los Theorem"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35ef9870c318436f\" href=\"?note=35ef9870c318436f\" title=\"93-df-first-order-ultraproduct\">93-df-first-order-ultraproduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1f813209c75e1\" href=\"?note=56c1f813209c75e1\" title=\"93-df-first-order-satisfaction\">93-df-first-order-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7cc13e0d91069bbd\" href=\"?note=7cc13e0d91069bbd\" title=\"93-df-set-ultrafilter\">93-df-set-ultrafilter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-los-theorem---Los-Theorem\">lem-los-theorem - Los Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(I\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A:I\\to V\">\\(\\mathfrak A:I\\to V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)\\)</span> for every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\">\\(i\\in I\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> has free variables in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a\\in(P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I))^n\">\\(\\bar a\\in(P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I))^n\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}\\)</span> are the fully indexed constructors of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"35ef9870c318436f\" href=\"?note=35ef9870c318436f\" title=\"93-df-first-order-ultraproduct\">93-df-first-order-ultraproduct</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}\\)</span> is the sourced free-variable map and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fo}\">\\(\\mathrm{fo}\\)</span> is its mnemonic sort tag.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;I\\in V\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\mathfrak A:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\n\\land P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\n\\land\\bar a\\in\\left(P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\right)^n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L)\n\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\bigl[\n\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}(\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,n)/\\bar x\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\leftrightarrow\n\\{i\\in I:\\mathfrak A(i)\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[\n\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}(\\bar a,i;n)/\\bar x]\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;I\\in V\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\mathfrak A:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\n\\land P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\n\\land\\bar a\\in\\left(P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\right)^n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L)\n\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\bigl[\n\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}(\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,n)/\\bar x\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\leftrightarrow\n\\{i\\in I:\\mathfrak A(i)\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[\n\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}(\\bar a,i;n)/\\bar x]\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Los theorem transfers satisfaction between an ultraproduct and an ultrafilter-large set of factors.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-los-theorem---Los-Theorem","text":"lem-los-theorem - Los Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-first-order-ultraproduct","status":"resolved","id":"35ef9870c318436f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-ultraproduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"56c1f813209c75e1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"7cc13e0d91069bbd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-ultraproduct","status":"resolved","id":"35ef9870c318436f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}$, $\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}$ are the fully indexed constructors of [[93-df-first-order-ultraproduct]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A:I\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)","display":false},{"tex":"P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\neq\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar a\\in(P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I))^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fo}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&I\\in V\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\mathfrak A:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\n\\land P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\n\\land\\bar a\\in\\left(P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\right)^n\\\\\n&\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L)\n\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\bigl[\n\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}(\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,n)/\\bar x\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\leftrightarrow\n\\{i\\in I:\\mathfrak A(i)\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[\n\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}(\\bar a,i;n)/\\bar x]\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2109,"backlinks":[{"id":"602433be409bad14","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["35ef9870c318436f","56c1f813209c75e1","7cc13e0d91069bbd"]}